{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28443","headline":"罢锺陵幕吏十三年来泊湓浦感旧爲诗 · 杜牧","name":"罢锺陵幕吏十三年来泊湓浦感旧爲诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青梅雨中熟，樯倚酒旗边。\n故国残春梦，孤舟一褐眠。\n摇摇远堤柳，暗暗十程烟。\n南奏钟陵道，无因似昔年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28443.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28443","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}